// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P242641241" "I suppose you've heard about Bloody Bay, eh, {VillainName}? Everyone around here has. Aliens, asteroids, and strange powers: a regular villain's playground. If you're interested in grabbing yourself a bit of the power in that zone, I suggest you head over there and talk to Operative Oudot. Help him out, and you may be able to profit from it."
// AcceptString :
"P2650693902" "Talk to Operative Oudot"
// SendOffString :
"P4284127098" "Don't kid yourself; Operative Oudot's tasks are pretty dangerous. <br><br> <color red>Operative Oudot's tasks will send you into a PVP zone, where you may be killed by other players.</color>"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2893129273" "I'm telling you; you should talk to Operative Oudot. He's got the inside angle on Bloody Bay."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2056492063" "You must be {VillainName} - another of Lord Recluse's 'chosen', no doubt. Whatever. If you're here talking to me it means you're not scared to mix it up with Paragon City heroes while you help Arachnos achieve objectives here in Bloody Bay. <br><br><color red>I'll warn you now, the heroes out here are top-notch and will take you down if you turn your back for a second. If that scares you then maybe you'd best head back home to mama! Otherwise, step up to the plate.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - MI_Seer_Marino_Intro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1339991962" "I've heard a rumor about an Arachnos Fortunata Seer who's looking for freelancers of around your level of power to handle some jobs for her. Word is that Ghost Widow and the Wretch are involved somehow. Could be dangerous, could be profitable. Either way, I can set you up to meet with her."
// AcceptString :
"P4132420231" "Talk to Seer Marino"
// SendOffString :
"P1526835344" "This is just an introduction. You don't have to do her tasks, but I hear they may be pretty interesting."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P454629354" "Seer Marino is expecting you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P204216640" "I had a feeling that perhaps we had met before? I could be wrong, of course. That is a problem for we Seers of the Fortunata. As the years roll on, the here-and-now begins to blend with the soon-to-be, and we loose track if we let our minds wander. And all it seems my mind can do is wander these days. To thoughts of my youth, of the friends I've lost, and to my brother Paolo, dead all these years. But that is why I wished to speak with you. There are things I must know about what happened to my brother, and you have a growing reputation as someone who can get things done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - BB_Arachnos_Liason_Intro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P450759273" "You heard about Bloody Bay? Arachnos is recruiting villains there to fight against the heros coming in from Paragon City. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go talk with the Arachnos Warzone Liaison for Bloody Bay over in Cap Au Diable.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3910199264" "Speak with Arachnos Liaison for Bloody Bay"
// SendOffString :
"P695706355" "The Arachnos Liaison will give you an appraisal of the situation in Bloody Bay. You can then make the choice whether you want to get involved or not."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3721776199" "Speak with Arachnos Liaison"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3278531749" "Have you met with the Arachnos Liaison yet?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2202351734" "Greetings, {VillainName}. I'm the Arachnos Liaison for the hero versus villain PvP zone of Bloody Bay. <color red>Bloody Bay is a Player Vs. Player zone.</color> Bloody Bay is VERY dangerous, and if you go there, you almost certainly will be attacked by other players. <color red>Do not enter Bloody Bay unless you are willing to engage in Player Vs. Player combat.</color><br><br>If you are interested in entering Bloody Bay, you can get there by speaking to the Pilot beside me. Once there, you can talk to Warzone Operative Oudot in the safe zone. He can provide you with missions taking place throughout the zone. These missions will allow you to change the course of the battle by providing boosts to heroes or penalties to villains."

